From: Eugene Yasman <eyasman@codeaurora.org>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2014 12:31:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] defconfig: msm8994: Add SMB349 dual charger driver

Enable SMB349 dual charger driver.

Change-Id: I65e0c80db4bc981fdb5437075808d543d9b0615a
Signed-off-by: Eugene Yasman <eyasman@codeaurora.org>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/msm8994-perf_defconfig | 1 +
 arch/arm64/configs/msm8994_defconfig      | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994-perf_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994-perf_defconfig
index dbaa213..2eaeb16 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994-perf_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994-perf_defconfig
@@ -286,6 +286,7 @@ CONFIG_PINCTRL_MSM_TLMM=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_SYSFS=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_QPNP_PIN=y
 CONFIG_SMB135X_CHARGER=y
+CONFIG_SMB349_DUAL_CHARGER=y
 CONFIG_QPNP_SMBCHARGER=y
 CONFIG_QPNP_FG=y
 CONFIG_BATTERY_BCL=y
diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994_defconfig
index 10e4b05..e0843aa 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/msm8994_defconfig
@@ -297,6 +297,7 @@ CONFIG_PINCTRL_MSM_TLMM=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_SYSFS=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_QPNP_PIN=y
 CONFIG_SMB135X_CHARGER=y
+CONFIG_SMB349_DUAL_CHARGER=y
 CONFIG_QPNP_SMBCHARGER=y
 CONFIG_QPNP_FG=y
 CONFIG_BATTERY_BCL=y
